ocal-126","title":"ब्रह्मेश्वरादि सुदुरूह पदारविन्द, श्रीमत्पराग परमाद्भुत वैभवाया","category":"Shloka","sanskrit_text":"ब्रह्मेश्वरादि सुदुरूह पदारविन्द, श्रीमत्पराग परमाद्भुत वैभवायाः |सर्वार्थ साररस वर्षि कृपार्द्रदृष्टे, तस्या नमोऽस्तु वृषभानुभुवो महिम्ने | |","hindi_text":"ब्रह्मेश्वरादि सुदुरूह पदारविन्द, श्रीमत्पराग परमाद्भुत वैभवायाः |\nसर्वार्थ साररस वर्षि कृपार्द्रदृष्टे, तस्या नमोऽस्तु वृषभानुभुवो महिम्ने | |\n- श्री हित हरिवंश महाप्रभु - श्री राधा सुधा निधि (2)\nजिनके चरण कमल ब्रह्मा, शंकर आदि के लिए भी अत्यंत दुरूह हैं, जिन चरण कमलों का शोभामय पराग परम अद्बुध वैभवशाली है, एवं जिनकी कृपा दृष्टि मात्र से प्रेम रस का वर्षण होता है, ऐसी वृषभानु नंदनी श्री राधा को नमन है।","english_text":null,"english_translation":"Obeisances to the glory of Sri Vrsabhanu's daughter Shri Radha. The glories of her lotus feet knows no bounds. Such is the magnitude of those lotus feet that It is very difficult for even Lord Brahma, Siva and all the demigods to attain the pollen of her lotus feet. Her merciful glance showers the best of all nectars!","description":"https://www.brajrasik.org/hi/articles/5a73e6bc82274812fecf9672/brahmeshwaradi-suduruh-padarvind-shrimat-parag-param-shri-hit-harivansh-mahaprabhu-shri-radha-sudha-nidhi-2","author":"श्री हित हरिवंश महाप्रभु  श्री राधा सुधा निधि (2)","status":"published","content_text":"ब्रह्मेश्वरादि सुदुरूह पदारविन्द, श्रीमत्पराग परमाद्भुत वैभवायाः |\nसर्वार्थ साररस वर्षि कृपार्द्रदृष्टे, तस्या नमोऽस्तु वृषभानुभुवो महिम्ने | |\n- श्री हित हरिवंश महाप्रभु - श्री राधा सुधा निधि (2)\nजिनके चरण कमल ब्रह्मा, शंकर आदि के लिए भी अत्यंत दुरूह हैं, जिन चरण कमलों का शोभामय पराग परम अद्बुध वैभवशाली है, एवं जिनकी कृपा दृष्टि मात्र से प्रेम रस का वर्षण होता है, ऐसी वृषभानु नंदनी श्री राधा को नमन है।","tags":["Braj Rasik","Mass Import"],"image_urls":[],"video_urls":[],"media_links":[],"source_url":"https://www.brajrasik.org/hi/articles/5a73e6bc82274812fecf9672/brahmeshwaradi-suduruh-padarvind-shrimat-parag-param-shri-hit-harivansh-mahaprabhu-shri-radha-sudha-nidhi-2","slug":"brahmeshvaradi-suduruh-padaravind-shrimatparag-paramadbhut-vaibhavaya"}],"imageUrl":null}}]}]],null],null],null]},[null,["$","$L5",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentPath":["children","hi","children","ragas","children","$6","children"],"error":"$undefined","errorStyles":"$undefined","errorScripts":"$undefined","template":["$","$L7",null,{}],"templateStyles":"$undefined","templateScripts":"$undefined","notFound":"$undefined","notFoundStyles":"$undefined"}]],null]},[null,["$","$L5",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentPath":["children","hi","children","ragas","children"],"error":"$undefined","errorStyles":"$undefined","errorScripts":"$undefined","template":["$","$L7",null,{}],"templateStyles":"$undefined","templateScripts":"$undefined","notFound":"$undefined","notFoundStyles":"$undefined"}]],null]},[[null,["$","div",null,{"lang":"hi","children":["$","$L5",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentPath":["children","hi","children"],"error":"$undefined","errorStyles":"$undefined","errorScripts":"$undefined","template":["$","$L7",null,{}],"templateStyles":"$undefined","templateScripts":"$undefined","notFound":"$undefined","notFoundStyles":"$undefined"}]}]],null],null]},[[[["$","link","0",{"rel":"stylesheet","href":"/_next/static/css/cbf73327883ccb7f.css","precedence":"next","crossOrigin":"$undefined"}],["$","link","1",{"rel":"stylesheet","href":"/_next/static/css/fe995a1e4635138b.css","precedence":"next","crossOrigin":"$undefined"}],["$","link","2",{"rel":"stylesheet","href":"/_next/static/css/848f1edf91a8622f.css","precedence":"next","crossOrigin":"$undefined"}]],["$","html",null,{"lang":"en","className":"dark","children":["$","body",null,{"className":"antialiased","children":["$","$L8",null,{"children":["$","$L5",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentPath":["children"],"error":"$undefined","errorStyles":"$undefined","errorScripts":"$undefined","template":["$","$L7",null,{}],"templateStyles":"$undefined","template